# BBQ Lentils

Instapot BBQ Lentils

## Ingredients
- 1 bag dry lentils (1 pound)
- 1 onion, chopped
- celery, chopped
- BBQ sauce
- Veggie broth, 4 cups


Chop veggies
Put into Instapot
Add a little water
Saute for a few minutes
Add dry lentils, mix
Add half to full cup of BBQ sauce
Add 4 cups veggie broth
Seal Instapot
Set to PC, 20-24 minutes
After done with PC, let sit on pressure
Wait 5 minutes
Release pressure

Optionally add salt, black pepper, jalapeno peppers
